 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A shoot will come up from the stump of Jesse",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From his roots a branch will bear fruit",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit of the LORD will rest on him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Wisdom and understanding fill his view",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit of counsel and might",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit of knowledge and the fear of the LORD",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His delight will be in the fear of the LORD",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.31,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Righteousness and justice are his song",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He will not judge by what his eyes see",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nor decide by what his ears hear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With righteousness he will judge the poor",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And with justice decide for the lowly of the earth",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit of counsel and might",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit of knowledge and the fear of the LORD",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.48,
